    <briefdescription>
<para>Public API of the DYNAMIXEL Protocol 2.0 library. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module groups the public interface and its supporting submodules: <ref refid="group__dxl2__config" kindref="compound">Configuration</ref>, <ref refid="group__dxl2__defs" kindref="compound">Definitions</ref>, <ref refid="group__dxl2__protocol" kindref="compound">Codec</ref> and <ref refid="group__dxl2__link" kindref="compound">Link</ref>.</para>
<para>Include this single header to use the library: <itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="dxl2__config_8h" kindref="compound">dxl2_config.h</ref> build-time configuration (buffer sizes) </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="dxl2__defs_8h" kindref="compound">dxl2_defs.h</ref> instructions, error codes, IDs, little-endian helpers </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="dxl2__protocol_8h" kindref="compound">dxl2_protocol.h</ref> CRC-16, incremental parser, encoder with byte stuffing </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="dxl2__link_8h" kindref="compound">dxl2_link.h</ref> transport-independent link (stream in, packets out) </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
